; FARO - menu/stat UI tiles (ui-designer). 42 tiles, one tileset so it fits one vram_order slot:
; it alternates with the overworld tileset part A (44 tiles) in the BG $9000 block, after ui (12) +
; font (46 with the E14 glyphs) + font_lower (26): 12 + 46 + 26 + 42 = 126 <= 128. Loaded with the
; LCD off for BATTLE and for every full screen (CUADERNO, MOCHILA, EQUIPO, COCINA, RECETAS, TIENDA,
; CAMP, CAPTURAS, OPCIONES, NOMBRE). $8800-$8FFF stays free for pictures (creature 7x7, player
; back, biome strip, item icon 2x2, camp scene). APPEND ONLY. Runs the code uses:
;   BAR_0..BAR_8          (9, consecutive: BAR_0 + n = n px of fill, n = 0..8; bar = BAR_L + 8 + BAR_R)
;   BOWL_FULL..BOWL_EMPTY (4, band order: sac >= 60, 25-59, 1-24, 0)
;   ST_NET ST_CALM ST_LIT ST_FLY (4, creature flags ENREDADO CALMADO ILUMINADO VOLANDO)
;   POCKET_ITEMS..POCKET_LANTERNS (4, MOCHILA pocket order: Objetos Comida Artilugios Farolillos)
;   FAM_BICHO..FAM_BRUMA  (7, family order of GDD 3.4: BICHO BESTIA AVE PEZ REPTIL FLORA BRUMA)
;   DMG_CORTE..DMG_FUEGO  (4, damage types 0-3; type 4 LUZ uses ST_LIT)
; Icons are drawn on glyph rows 0-6 like the font (row 7 empty) so they sit on a text line.

